<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Iceball</h1>
<p>Sphere: Frost Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 100)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast iceball &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast iceball</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster's body trembles with the words 'Bolat fesfroq', and the 
moisture in the air gathers into a ball of ice that is hurled at the 
target. The better your magic and your frost sphere, the harder it hits. 
Like all cold, it cares little for armour: it strikes plate nearly as 
hard as clothes. A shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
